    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936130/extras/aa76928c5643583a3aee435004ccdb2c.avif?t=1739077175\" data-has-big width=800 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The link can be found on the right!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A boss raid where the boss is also a player!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A team of 3 guardians. 6 classes, 12 perks, and 36 abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An creature from the 3rd dimension, ready to singlehandedly destroy their world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only 5 minutes until the collapse of the 2nd dimension! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual quirky rogue-like 1 vs 3 asymmetrical PvP experience: 5 Minute Raid! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936130/extras/b8f47b39808c8d981423ae751b01a690.poster.avif?t=1739077175\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936130/extras/b8f47b39808c8d981423ae751b01a690.webm?t=1739077175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2936130/extras/b8f47b39808c8d981423ae751b01a690.mp4?t=1739077175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The most 'humanlike' boss you'll ever find in a raid game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Squash those puny 2D 'heroes' as the raid boss from the 3rd dimension!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2-4 party game with your friends at custom match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level up as much as possible within 5 minutes to gain abilities and power up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A total of 36 unique abilities for Guardians.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 different Bosses with completely different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 12 Boss perks to customize your playstyle further!</p></li></ul>",
